Z||000001||1FST2M6||11-07-2000||02:22 PM||||i'm sure you could do somthing similar but for the money you'll spend on R&D you can buy a design one kit, or a low hp V8 install. Not trying to shoot ya down... I've thought about mounting a supercharger in the trunk and using Archies waterpump  coged pulley to run it off the crank... pulling in air from the hole that GM punched for the vents and only haveing to cut a slot for the belt and carged air piping... not any really crazy mods.. just REALLY time consuming. you'd deffinatly be the only one!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mouse.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstsig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
